        "content": "The Sol Central and Grand Exchange boards only show the current bid and ask. Yesterday's quote is gone once the order fills or gets repriced. If you want to know whether an energy crystal spread is widening or just noisy, you need your own record. I note the best bid and ask each visit and compare after a few days. It's crude, but it works. What do you use to track quote history across stations: a spreadsheet habit, a script in your own client, or just memory?",
